 Instructions**.
 
+### Agent harness
+
+New Slack sessions run on **OpenCode** unless an administrator chooses **Claude Agent** under
+**Settings → Integrations → Slack → Agent harness**. The choice applies to sessions started after it
+is saved; running sessions keep the harness they were created on. Claude Agent runs Anthropic models
+only, so with it selected the default model list offers Anthropic models alone, and saving a
+non-Anthropic default model is rejected. Every other model source (the deployment's `DEFAULT_MODEL`,
+a user's App Home model, a `!model` flag on the first request or on a follow-up) is checked when it
+is used: Slack replies with an error naming the model instead of starting the session or sending the
+follow-up. Claude Agent sessions can use a connected Claude account; see
+[Claude Agent](../CLAUDE_AGENT.md).
+
